    "body": "Thanks again, all. I _think_ 0f23e3ab483f412c52cb24ffde863f3602c9a988 gets it right as to changing the second parameter into a host - I renamed it as `effectiveDomain` since it's basically refactoring that call to `concept-origin-effective-domain` outside the algorithm. Other ideas welcome :)",
