    "updated_at": "2017-02-20T18:16:42Z",
    "body": "It seems like I should be able to leave out the `<span data-x=\"...\">` when I call this in the setter, but that yields the error:\r\n\r\n>`Error: missing <dfn> for topic \"is not a registrable domain suffix of and is not equal to\" explicitly from <span> element containing \"is not a registrable domain suffix of and is not equal to\"; previous heading contents are \"7.5.1 Relaxing the same-origin restriction\"`\r\n\r\nAlso, the line for the `data-lt` now exceeds 100 chars by itself... so I'll leave whatever cleanup is needed there to you fine folk. @annevk's inclusion of \"or is equal to\" is added in 6170adc13b42b1b29b40bcddc33325321f07542d. ",
